[{"op":"ifFalse","to":69,"condition":["==",["v","f",3],1]},{"op":"background","image":"bg018"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",306],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊，朋也～」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？哟。」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":12,"condition":["==",["v","f",300],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"藤林杏。我２年级时的同班同学。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她是我们班班长的双胞胎姐姐，是为数不多能和我们正常交流的女生…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"性格的话…嘛…很差就是了…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"现在是隔壁班的。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「刚才去哪了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「稍微溜达了一下。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哼ー。莫非是这个？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她竖起小拇指贼兮兮地笑着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我哪来的这种桃花运。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「？似乎还挺累的？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「说不定我还挺会照顾人。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky26"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「什么？这很好笑吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…是啊…尽管笑吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不准笑！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「什么啊。一会儿要我笑，等我笑了又开始生气真麻烦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唰啦…。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg021b"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「唉呀，回来了啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「什么，你在教室的吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你什么意思。难道我留在教室里不行吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，是不行啊。因为会辣眼睛。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「只会毫无意义地增加二氧化碳。还不如会增加点氧气的杂草？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你们不觉得说的有点过分了吗！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「话说，藤林杏！你为什么会在这里！？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「什么啊。我难道不可以在这里？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「啊…那个…倒也不是这么说…呃…预备铃已经响过了，还是回自己教室比较好吧…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky26"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「上课铃还没响对吧。你这人怎么这么胆小啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我，我胆子很小吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky33"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「和水蚤差不多？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「浮游生物！！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…喂，水蚤，那是什么？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯？哪个？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「…不小心还应答了！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「总之给我回答出来。我是说那一群人，也不知道是谁的座位…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那里？是班长的座位附近吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「藤林？是要交什么东西吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊ー，一定是在玩占卜吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…占卜？」"},{"op":"goto","to":108},{"op":"background","image":"bg021e"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",313],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"午休…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"教室的一角聚集了不少人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那群人似乎在排队等待着什么。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那是怎么回事？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「天知道。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和春原从小卖部买来面包和饮料，看向那边。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"吵吵闹闹还挺热闹。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"其中有的人似乎还挺沮丧。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「看地方应该是班长那里。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「是要交什么东西吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「藤林那吗…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「大概是在玩占卜吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哼ー」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「占卜吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「话说为什么你会在这啊？！」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",306],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky32"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯？什么啊，我难道不可以在这里？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不，绝对没有这样的事…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原被瞪了一眼后立马就怂了。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":105,"condition":["==",["v","f",300],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"藤林杏。我２年级时的同班同学。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她是我们班班长的双胞胎姐姐，是为数不多能和我们正常交流的女生…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"性格的话…嘛…很差就是了…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"按说现在是隔壁班的才对…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么了。找妹妹有事吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky17"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「没呀。单纯是来打发下时间。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky25b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「话说…还是那么有人气啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「什么东西？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「椋的占卜。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「莫非说，那群人的中心是班长？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「没错。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…她的占卜就那么准吗…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky24a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「就算是个不显眼的妹子，也会有特别的技能呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咚！"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好疼！你干什么啊！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「不准说我妹妹坏话。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh17"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我是在夸她啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咚！"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好疼！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你这家伙。语文是体育老师教的吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「的确没及格过。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你为什么会知道啊？！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「在你房间里找到的。翻了一下抽屉里面有好多。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我，我就没有一点儿隐私吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哈哈哈，还幻想什么呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊哈哈，就是说啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你们是不是有病。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊，对了。废柴我问你。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh21"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「谁是废柴啊！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你跳出来自然是你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「也有可能是你好不好。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「错了。就是在说你。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh26"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「…是这样啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那么…有什么事？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你去让椋占卜一下吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「唉，我？」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":357,"condition":["==",["v","f",300],1]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「朋也已经占卜过好多次了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？啊，是的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「是什么占卜？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「什么占卜吗，那自然是──…」"},{"op":"choice","id":"3418:2009440","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"胸部占卜","value":0,"serial":2009440},{"text":"扑克牌占卜","value":1,"serial":2009450}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":260,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「耳朵借一下。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「唉？什么？是不能公之于众的占卜吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「别废话。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（如此这般如此这般…如此这般…）"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「唉？！真的！？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（如此这般…如此这般如此这般…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「在，在那堆人的中心…怎，怎么会…！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（…如此这般如此这般…如此这般…如此这般…）"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「而，而且不隔着衣服？！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「话说，冈崎你都玩过好几次了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我对把眼睛瞪得溜圆的春原，笑着竖起了大拇指。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「杏，你的妹妹好厉害！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哎？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「看起来乖巧老实，没想到是这么开放的女孩子。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky26"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「…朋也，你对阳平说了什么…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没什么啊？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我，我去让她给我占卜一下。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「对了，是不是先洗一下手会更好一些？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，用不着那么麻烦。看准时机抓下去就是。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「真够爷们的！我去去就来！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「…为什么这家伙会手舞足蹈的啊？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我骗他说是胸部占卜，他似乎当真了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「呵…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「喂！你想对椋做什么啊！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘭！！"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「噗嘎！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不知她是从哪拿出来的，也不知她是什么时候扔出去的…，那本文言文词典已经嵌在春原的后脑勺上了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后一脸怒容地望向我。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky32"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「朋也～…你这人啊～…！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「开个小玩笑而已。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「唉！原来是骗我的吗！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「开玩笑也是要挑对象的啊！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「就算幼儿园的小孩不会上当，可阳平会上当的啊！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我说…被这样说我心好痛的说…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「抱歉，我没考虑这么多。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「被你这样说抱歉，仿佛是我被坐实了一样好痛苦…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「打起精神来，去让藤林占卜一下吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「虽说其实是扑克牌占卜。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你看，说不定能看到你余生的希望哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「难道现在看不到吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky31"]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「唉？你那莫非能看见的表情是什么意思？！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky26"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「呃ー，毕竟你想…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh26"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「可恶！你们等着，我将来一定会变得比你们BIG！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这么说着他奔向了教室外面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「喂，你去哪呢？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「撒尿！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这家伙连幼儿园小孩都不如…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「我刚才不就这么说了嘛…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…话说回来…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你妹妹的占卜，一点都不准吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊，看出来啦？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这还看不出来？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「可不许对她本人说哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我才不会说呢。」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",303],"value":1},{"op":"ifFalse","to":356,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是扑克牌占卜。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「感觉这占卜没什么说服力啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「她占卜的结果是很具体的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「一定会应验的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「真的？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯嗯。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「既然这样，那我就去试试吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原神气活现地向人群走去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和杏笑嘻嘻地目送着他。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",322],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我说杏啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我收住目光和笑容，对她说到。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「怎么啦？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏也一样，一边目送着春原的背影一边回应到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你妹妹那套占卜…我差不多看懂了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「我想也是。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那个废柴会占卜出什么结果啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「不管搞成什么样应该都挺好玩的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你是想看他笑话对吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你不也是吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「也是。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"背对着我们不怀好意的目光，春原向前走去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「喂，你们都给我闪开。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他驱散人群，来到藤林跟前。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接着他大喇喇地坐到桌前。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「果然是用扑克牌占卜啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「是啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「用塔罗牌之类的应该更好吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「那孩子没有塔罗牌。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦，是吗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"藤林唰唰地在春原面前洗着牌。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啊，掉出来了…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她慌忙拾起牌。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接着她把牌呈扇形摆开…让春原抽出三张。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"藤林死死盯着那三张牌…说了些什么。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原听着她的话，正一个劲地点头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…看来占卜的结果还不错啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「…好像是。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「啊哈哈哈ー，你们听我说。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「可怜的小丑回来了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「小丑？你说什么呢？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没什么，你别在意。话说，结果怎样？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嘿，简直太棒了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「『迄今为止的辛酸生活即将画上句号。』」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「『恋情的开端便是新生活的开端。』」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「『下一位与你相遇的女性，将会和你牵起命运的红线。』」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你听听，我接下来的人生是玫瑰色的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，他满足地笑了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和杏面面相觑，然后不约而同地，同时拍了拍春原的肩膀。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯？怎么了？这是做什么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「加油吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky17"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你的未来一定可以通过自己的双手去改写。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「虽然不是很懂，还是谢谢啦！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，他竖起大拇指，露出了爽朗的笑容。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"简直就是个清新脱俗的小丑…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky26"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「…真是可怜…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯？你们说什么了吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「没事，你别在意。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哦对了，我要去下厕所，冈崎你来吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你一个人去吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你好不上道啊。一起去小便不是友情的证明吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我现在又撒不出来，去也没用啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「说的也是。那我一个人去啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「慢走不送。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"坦荡地接受了占卜的结果，春原带着奇异的骄傲神情走出教室。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他的背上微微带着些污渍，似乎在预示着他今后的命运。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",313],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…恋情的开端便是新生活的开端吗…」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",302],"value":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",303],"value":1},{"op":"goto","to":533},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊，朋也你来也可以哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「占卜吗…」"},{"op":"choice","id":"3418:2010810","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"自己来占卜","value":0,"serial":2010810},{"text":"让春原占卜","value":1,"serial":2010820}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":435,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「准吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「这要等占卜完之后才知道。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「心诚则灵…是吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你要去？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「去试试。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那下一个就是我啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是啊，你去算算命，说不定就会对人生产生希望了呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你这是绕着弯骂我无药可救吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，我应该不是在绕着弯说。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「话说，你真觉得还有人比你更差？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「过分！你们什么叫语言暴力吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哈哈哈，这家伙在说什么呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「陈述事实可不算是暴力哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh26"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你管一个笨蛋叫笨蛋，也算是说坏话好吗！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「喂，你刚才这话可是自认无药可救哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不…不对！刚才的话是我被绕进去了…这个…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「读书不行，没有女友，天天迟到，颜艺大师…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「贪恋权势，欺软怕硬，没有朋友，还爱哼哼…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky22a"]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你，你们什么意思，那充满怜悯的眼神是怎么回事！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky23a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「不…这怎么说呢…抱歉。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「有些话可以说，可有些话不能说啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh26"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「可恶！你们等着，我将来一定会变得比你们BIG！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「我们是不是有点过分了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「对了，那家伙还是有一个优点的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「是什么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「能很快振作起来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哦，这样啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好了，我还是去接受占卜吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯，你就好好加油吧。」"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg021b"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",322],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「唔…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯？你回来啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你这表情有点奇怪哦？测出什么怪结果了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，怎么说呢，应该是件好事，可周围的反应貌似不太好…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…你这什么表情啊？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「没什么。话说，结果怎样？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「说我『近期能找到恋人收获幸福』。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky26"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「所以说，大家表情怎么都那么阴沉？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「算了，反正占卜就只是占卜而已。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…？」"},{"op":"return"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":533,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「春原，还是你去吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯，也对。我也有点兴趣，就去测测看吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不过话说回来，到底是什么占卜啊？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「不管是算恋爱还是找失物都神准哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「恋爱的失物可不可以啊？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯，没有问题哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「怎么办，冈崎，我的未来有点太耀眼了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「还没占卜，你的头脑就这么秀逗了？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「好啦好啦，你赶紧去吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「呃…好！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在杏的教唆下，春原走向藤林的位子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我说。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯？怎么了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你妹妹的占卜真的那么准吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…看你那表情，一定有鬼吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你就看着吧，会很好玩的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏笑嘻嘻地看着春原的背影。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「喂，你们都给我闪开。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他驱散人群，来到藤林跟前。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接着他大喇喇地坐到桌前。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"藤林带着无可奈何的表情，开始洗牌。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…塔罗牌占卜？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「不是，是扑克牌占卜。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「感觉没什么说服力啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「椋的厉害之处就在用扑克也很准啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…真的准？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「所以说你这表情到底什么意思啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊，他回来了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哼ー，哼哼哼～」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他看起来心情非常好。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嘿，简直太棒了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「『迄今为止的辛酸生活即将画上句号』。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「『恋情的开端便是新生活的开端』。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「『下一位与你相遇的女性，将会和你牵起命运的红线』。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你听听，我接下来的人生是玫瑰色的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，他满足地笑了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏拍了拍他的肩膀。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯？怎么了？这是做什么？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky17"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「加油吧，你的未来一定可以通过自己的双手去改写。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「虽然不是很懂，还是谢谢啦！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，他竖起大拇指，露出了爽朗的笑容。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「…哦，重要的是要知难而退哦…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯？你说什么了吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「没事，你别在意。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哦对了，我要去下厕所，冈崎你来吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你一个人去吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你好不上道啊。一起去小便不是友情的证明吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我现在又撒不出来，去也没用啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「说的也是。那我一个人去啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「慢走不送。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…你这反应是什么意思啊…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky17"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哎，你马上就会懂了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky26"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「…恋情的开端便是新生活的开端吗…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唰啦！"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",321],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"哒哒哒哒哒！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？春原…？好快啊…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你是真没说错…」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",302],"value":1},{"op":"goto","to":603},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「对了，顺便问问，你有喜欢的女孩子吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…啊？你没头没脑问什么呢？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky25a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「随便问问。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「什么叫随便问问…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你看，不良少年不都是莫名地帅吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「所以大部分都有女朋友啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也不知她哪来的根据这么说…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你这先入为主的观念有点怪啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「不是吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「至少在这所学校不现实吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「光是跟不良少年谈恋爱，那帮老师就要把眼镜瞪出来了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky25a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哦…难不成，你是因为这个才不找女朋友的？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「倒不是因为这个。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「纯粹是，因为没有女生会好事到来跟我交往。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky10a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「要是有，你会和她交往吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「假如说，有女孩子说喜欢你，你会和她交往吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那要看是谁了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我想了想，这么回答了她。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过这也可以说是理所当然的答案了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"毕竟这种事双方都应该有选择的权利。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky18b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听到我这么回答，杏用手抵着嘴沉吟了片刻。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「说的也是啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky17b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「如果你是个来者不拒的家伙，那看上你的女孩子也太可怜了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她环抱着双臂，自顾自地点着头理解到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「话说，你怎么会突然问起这个？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky25a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯？没什么。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「没什么特别的意思。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那你自己呢？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那你呢，有这方面的故事吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊哈哈哈哈，你说什么呢，这可是本小姐哦？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是你又怎么了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她笑着的脸僵住了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"倒是说句话啊…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky21a"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哎，这些都无所谓啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「怎么说呢，你看，我要是想找，一两个男朋友还不是信手拈来，对吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对你个头啊…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"简单来说，根本就没这回事。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你这表情什么意思～！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没什么。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「我跟你可不一样，我只是不想找而已哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「别把我当成你的同类。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我也只是不想找而已。你别想太多。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊真是受不了你！我要说东你偏往西！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那是你好吧！」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":598,"condition":["==",["v","f",302],0]},{"op":"return"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唰啦！"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",321],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"哒哒哒哒哒！"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然，教室的门被一下子拉开，有个什么东西猛地冲了进来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后在教桌前绊了一跤，用华丽地用脸贴地滑行来到我和杏之间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"地上的灰都被扬起来了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky18"]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「呼哧呼哧…呼哧呼哧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「新玩法嘛。好玩吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「现，现在不是说这个的时候。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原气喘吁吁满头大汗，看着教室门口。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「出什么事了？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「什么出什么事了，我刚才在走廊上撞见一个女孩子。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「然后你就逃回来了？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「太差劲了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh21"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不对！是在拐角撞到头了啊！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你们不觉得，超有命运的感觉吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「就跟上学路上撞到一个叼着面包的转校生是一样的！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原握紧拳头，热情地述说着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这家伙到底在做着什么梦啊…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky26"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「到头来，你究竟想说什么？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「她好可爱。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…然后？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我都说了是命运啊！红线！New Life！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky26"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「没听懂。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你妹妹的占卜啊！我觉得她就是我命运红线的另一端。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「所以我就去泡她了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「怎么泡的？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我立刻就抱上去了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这家伙…白痴啊…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「接着她忽然就叫起来了？还一边在哭。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「就在这时──…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咣！"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",323],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然，教室的门…被粗暴地拉开了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"出现在门外的…我记得是三年级的橄榄球部员。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一眼就能看出，他很生气。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「噫！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原发出惨叫，躲到了我和杏的身后。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"橄榄球部员","text":"「喂，这个教室有没有藏着一个金发混蛋？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"橄榄球部员","text":"「这人没来由地对我女朋友耍流氓。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「帮，帮我蒙混过去吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和杏各自向左右移开半步。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接着我们同时指向中间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"橄榄球部员","text":"「你丫在这是吧！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你们两个是魔鬼吧！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"橄榄球部员","text":"「跟我去厕所走一趟。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「唔…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唔啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊ーー－－－ーー…"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原就这样被拖走了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「迄今为止的辛酸生活即将画上句号吗…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「死亡，某种意义上来说也是个句号呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对着那扇开着的门，我们凝望了许久。"},{"op":"return"},{"op":"return"}]